+## ✅ Lab 08 – Nmap Scan Traffic Analysis
+
+### Objective
+
+Captured and analyzed network traffic generated by Nmap host discovery, SYN scans, and TCP Connect scans to understand how reconnaissance activity appears at the packet level, including service detection and SSH banner grabbing.
+
+### Topics Covered
+
+- Host Discovery Traffic
+- SYN Scan vs. TCP Connect Scan Packet Behavior
+- SYN/ACK and RST Packet Analysis
+- Service Version Detection Traffic
+- SSH Service Banner Identification
+- Reconnaissance Traffic Fingerprinting (SOC Perspective)
+
+📂 **Lab Folder**
+
+[Lab-08-Nmap-Scan-Traffic-Analysis](Lab-08-Nmap-Scan-Traffic-Analysis)
+
